# App Engine's rendered root Dockerfile needs only the runtime package and the
# packaging/startup inputs below. Keep tests, planning artifacts, local caches,
# and bytecode out of the image build context.
**
!.dockerignore
!Dockerfile
!start.sh
!Makefile
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!policyengine_api/
!policyengine_api/**

**/__pycache__/**
**/*.py[co]
**/*.db
**/*.sqlite*
**/.env*
**/*.key
**/*.pem
